        :rulingText """Loot's first ability doesn't change his power. It changes only the amount of combat damage he assigns. All other rules and effects that check his power use the real value, even if they cause damage "equal to a creature's power" to be dealt. In that case, if Loot's power is negative, no damage is dealt."""@en ] ,
